# Stitch (Compat-Alias)

This is a compatibility alias for older Stitch-oriented requests. For new work, use the canonical frontend design modules directly.

## Canonical Routes

| Component | Skill |
| --- | --- |
| Main design execution | `frontend-design` |
| Design-system refresh | `frontend-design-system` |
| Screen brief generation | `frontend-design-screen-brief` |
| Implementation handoff | `frontend-design-implementation-handoff` |

## Routing

When `stitch` is requested:
1. Start with `frontend-design` as the default canonical route.
2. Load `frontend-design-system` if the repo's design state or `.stitch/DESIGN.md` mirror is stale.
3. Load `frontend-design-screen-brief` when the next artifact is a compact screen brief.
4. Load `frontend-design-implementation-handoff` when a generated artifact must become repo-native UI code.

## Reference Skill

- `stitch`
